00:09:18,038 --> 00:09:21,101
You wanna tell your code what to do and not

219
00:09:21,245 --> 00:09:21,582
ask.

220
00:09:22,304 --> 00:09:24,388
And that's also why I wanted to cover this

221
00:09:24,388 --> 00:09:27,082
principle or this law here because this

