246
00:10:24,303 --> 00:10:27,107
If you write code with just functions

247
00:10:27,155 --> 00:10:29,943
without any classes because you are writing

248
00:10:30,055 --> 00:10:33,003
code in a procedural way or because you use

249
00:10:33,099 --> 00:10:35,871
functional programming, If you do either of

250
00:10:35,903 --> 00:10:39,540
these 2 things, then you still wanna ensure

251
00:10:39,732 --> 00:10:42,312
that inside of your functions, you don't dig

