00:10:42,456 --> 00:10:46,205
too deeply into received data unless that is

253
00:10:46,638 --> 00:10:48,688
kind of a data container only.

254
00:10:49,425 --> 00:10:53,831
And you also wanna tell, not ask, at least

255
00:10:53,847 --> 00:10:56,891
if it makes sense. You should always ask

