267
00:11:26,864 --> 00:11:29,188
So the Law of Demeter is super important,

268
00:11:29,332 --> 00:11:31,817
especially when working with classes and

269
00:11:31,817 --> 00:11:34,750
objects, but also if you think about the

270
00:11:34,863 --> 00:11:37,649
general idea behind it, in other kinds of

271
00:11:37,698 --> 00:11:38,010
code.
